ersion-badge\">v2.1.98</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Fixed command injection vulnerability, added Monitor tool, subprocess sandboxing with PID namespace isolation, improved permission checks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-09</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Claude Code Found a Linux Vulnerability Hidden for 23 Years\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v0.37.1</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gemini CLI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Dynamic sandbox expansion and worktree support for Linux and Windows. Broad nightly update featuring UI polish and new tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-09</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">Latest</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Aider</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Added support for Claude 4.5/4.6, Gemini 2.5 Flash/Lite, Gemini 3 preview, DeepSeek Reasoner, and GPT-5.3/5.