         <span>Product Hunt</span>\n   326→                    </div>\n   327→                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Zero token anxiety\"</div>\n   328→                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-03</div>\n   329→                </div>\n   330→\n   331→                <div class=\"item\">\n   332→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   333→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/sms021/RunawayContext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RunawayContext</a>\n   334→                    </div>\n   335→                    <div class=\"description\">\n   336→                        Universal framework for giving AI coding assistants persistent memory and project intelligence across sessions. Provides workspace-scoped memory that survives chat sessions.\n   337→                    </div>\n   338→                    <div class=\"meta\">\n   339→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   340→                        <span>GitHub</span>\n   341→                    </div>\n   342→                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-04</div>\n   343→                </div>\n   344→\n   345→                <div class=\"item\">\n   346→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   347→                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/claude-code-voice-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code Voice Mode</a>\n   348→                    </div>\n   349→                    <div class=\"description\">\n   350→                        Voice mode for Claude Code allowing developers to speak prompts instead of typing. Reached #1 Product of the Day on April 2, 2026.\n   351→                    </div>\n   352→                    <div class=\"meta\">\n   353→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   354→                        <span>Product Hunt</span>\n   355→                    </div>\n   356→                    <div class=\"quote\">\"#1 Product on Product Hunt\"</div>\n   357→                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-02</div>\n   358→                </div>\n   359→\n   360→                <div class=\"item\">\n   361→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   362→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/SafeRL-Lab/cheetahclaws\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cheetahclaws</a>\n   363→                    </div>\n   364→                    <div class=\"description\">\n   365→                        Nano Claude Code: fast, easy-to-use, Python-native personal AI assistant for any model. Built to work autonomously 24/7 with minimal resource requirements.\n   366→                    </div>\n   367→                    <div class=\"meta\">\n   368→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   369→                        <span>GitHub</span>\n   370→                    </div>\n   371→                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Built to Work for You Autonomously 24/7\"</div>\n   372→                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-01</div>\n   373→                </div>\n   374→\n   375→                <div class=\"item\">\n   376→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   377→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/he-yufeng/CoreCoder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CoreCoder</a>\n   378→                    </div>\n   379→                    <div class=\"description\">\n   380→                        Minimal AI coding agent (~950 LoC Python) inspired by Claude Code. Works with any LLM and provides clean, readable implementation. Think NanoGPT for coding agents.\n   381→                    </div>\n   382→                    <div class=\"meta\">\n   383→                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source AI coding agent</span>\n   384→                        <span>GitHub</span>\n   385→                    </div>\n   386→                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Think NanoGPT for coding agent\"</div>\n   387→                    