    "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agentic Coding Research Report - 2026-04-11</title>\n    <style>\n        * {\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n        }\n\n        body {\n            font-family: Verdana, Geneva, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            line-height: 1.5;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #000000;\n            padding: 10px;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 1400px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n        }\n\n        header {\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            padding: 10px 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n\n        header h1 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 18px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        header .subtitle {\n            font-size: 12px;\n            margin-top: 5px;\n            color: #000000;\n        }\n\n        .three-column-layout {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 40% 35% 25%;\n            gap: 15px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 1200px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n            }\n            .technical-insights {\n                grid-column: 1 / -1;\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (max-width: 768px) {\n            .three-column-layout {\n                grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            }\n        }\n\n        section {\n            background-color: #ffffff;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            padding: 12px;\n        }\n\n        section h2 {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n            padding-bottom: 8px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #ff6600;\n        }\n\n        .item {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n            padding-bottom: 12px;\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n        }\n\n        .item:last-child {\n            border-bottom: none;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            padding-bottom: 0;\n        }\n\n        .item-title {\n            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a {\n            color: #000000;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        .item-title a:visited {\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .description {\n            color: #000000;\n            margin-bottom: 5px;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n        }\n\n        .meta {\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .tag {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f0f0f0;\n            color: #828282;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            margin-top: 5px;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .quote {\n            font-style: italic;\n            color: #828282;\n            margin-top: 5px;\n            padding-left: 10px;\n            border-left: 2px solid #ff6600;\n            font-size: 11px;\n        }\n\n        .version-badge {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #ff6600;\n            color: #ffffff;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n        }\n\n        .update-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.release {\n            background-color: #e6f7e6;\n            color: #2d5016;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.feature {\n            background-color: #e6f3ff;\n            color: #1a4d8f;\n        }\n\n        .update-type.announcement {\n            background-color: #fff3e6;\n            color: #cc6600;\n        }\n\n        .topics {\n            margin-top: 5px;\n        }\n\n        .topic {\n            display: inline-block;\n            background-color: #f6f6ef;\n            color: #828282;\n            padding: 2px 5px;\n            margin-right: 3px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type {\n            display: inline-block;\n            padding: 2px 6px;\n            margin-right: 5px;\n            font-size: 10px;\n            border-radius: 2px;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n            font-weight: bold;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.technical {\n            background-color: #f0e6ff;\n            color: #5c3d99;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.opinion {\n            background-color: #ffe6f0;\n            color: #993d5c;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.discussion {\n            background-color: #e6f7ff;\n            color: #3d5c99;\n        }\n\n        .insight-type.tutorial {\n            background-color: #e6ffe6;\n            color: #3d995c;\n        }\n\n        footer {\n            text-align: center;\n            padding: 15px 0;\n            color: #828282;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #d4d4d4;\n            margin-top: 15px;\n        }\n\n        footer a {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n        }\n\n        footer a:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n\n        @media print {\n            body {\n                background-color: #ffffff;\n            }\n            section {\n                page-break-inside: avoid;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .stats {\n            margin-top: 10px;\n            padding-top: 10px;\n            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;\n            font-size: 11px;\n            color: #828282;\n        }\n\n        .external-link {\n            color: #828282;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-size: 11px;\n        }\n\n        .external-link:hover {\n            text-decoration: underline;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <header>\n            <h1>Agentic Coding Research Report</h1>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">April 11, 2026 - Daily updates on AI coding tools, agents, and developer productivity</div>\n        </header>\n\n        <main class=\"three-column-layout\">\n            <!-- New Products Section -->\n            <section class=\"new-products\">\n                <h2>New Products (14)</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/redknightlois/dbg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">dbg</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Universal CLI debugger interface giving AI agents direct visibility into runtime state across multiple debugging protocols. Enables agents to inspect variables, set breakpoints, and analyze execution flow.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"One CLI. Every debugger\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-11</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/senweaver/SenWeaverCoding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SenWeaverCoding</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Rust-first autonomous AI agent runtime and CLI code editor built on SenAgentOS. Applies Harness Engineering to code engineering with autonomous exploration, refactoring, testing, and debugging.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Performance, stability, security – fully harnessed\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-07</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/zooclaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ZooClaw</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Proactive team of AI specialists in one place. Acts as single entry point to multiple AI agents with structured domain expertise, automatically routing tasks to the right agent.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span>Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Zero token anxiety\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-03</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/sms021/RunawayContext\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RunawayContext</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Universal framework for giving AI coding assistants persistent memory and project intelligence across sessions. Provides workspace-scoped memory that survives chat sessions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-04</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/claude-code-voice-mode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code Voice Mode</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Voice mode for Claude Code allowing developers to speak prompts instead of typing. Reached #1 Product of the Day on April 2, 2026.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"#1 Product on Product Hunt\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-02</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/SafeRL-Lab/cheetahclaws\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cheetahclaws</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Nano Claude Code: fast, easy-to-use, Python-native personal AI assistant for any model. Built to work autonomously 24/7 with minimal resource requirements.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Built to Work for You Autonomously 24/7\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-01</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/he-yufeng/CoreCoder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CoreCoder</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Minimal AI coding agent (~950 LoC Python) inspired by Claude Code. Works with any LLM and provides clean, readable implementation. Think NanoGPT for coding agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source AI coding agent</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Think NanoGPT for coding agent\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-01</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/nanocode-project/nanocode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">nanocode</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Lightweight AI coding assistant built in Python (~1.9k lines). Provides minimal but functional implementation with tool use and agentic workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source AI coding agent</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-01</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/cursor-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cursor 3</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Unified workspace for parallel local/cloud agents and MCPs (Model Context Protocol). Major update enhancing Cursor AI IDE with multi-agent capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">AI IDE</span>\n                        <span>Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-01</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://getviktor.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Viktor</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        AI coworker that lives in Slack and automates workflows by observing team behavior. Proactively suggests automations and runs autonomously without manual setup.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span>Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"An AI coworker that actually does the work\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-01</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/future-agi/traceAI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">traceAI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Open-source LLM tracing framework designed specifically for GenAI applications. Captures every LLM call, prompt, token count, retrieval step, and agent decision.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">workflow agent</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Open-source LLM tracing that speaks GenAI, not HTTP\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-04-01</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anton-abyzov/ccx-rs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CCX-RS</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Community Claude Code eXtended — free, open-source AI coding assistant in Rust. Features 19 tools, multi-model support, and Claude Code-style TUI interface.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source AI coding agent</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"19 tools, multi-model, Claude Code-style TUI\"</div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-03-31</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/baton-2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Baton</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Desktop app for developing with AI coding agents. Run multiple agents in parallel, each in their own git-isolated workspace. Provides PR-ready code review.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">code agent</span>\n                        <span>Product Hunt</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-03-30</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://github.com/NiuTrans/ToFu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ToFu</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Self-hosted AI assistant with tool use, multi-agent orchestration, and coding copilot. Lightweight Flask + vanilla JS stack for complete self-hosted solution.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">open-source AI coding agent</span>\n                        <span>GitHub</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Released: 2026-03-30</div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n                <h2>Product Updates (12)</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.101</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Added /team-onboarding command, OS CA certificate trust, interactive Google Vertex AI setup, faster diff computation, and reduced memory usage.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-10</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v2.1.98</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Code</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Fixed command injection vulnerability, added Monitor tool, subprocess sandboxing with PID namespace isolation, improved permission checks.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-09</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"Claude Code Found a Linux Vulnerability Hidden for 23 Years\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v0.37.1</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gemini CLI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Dynamic sandbox expansion and worktree support for Linux and Windows. Broad nightly update featuring UI polish and new tools.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-09</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">Latest</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://aider.chat/HISTORY.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Aider</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Added support for Claude 4.5/4.6, Gemini 2.5 Flash/Lite, Gemini 3 preview, DeepSeek Reasoner, and GPT-5.3/5.4 across multiple providers.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-10</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">New</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cursor</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Bugbot learned rules from PR feedback, added MCP support for code reviews, introduced Cursor 3 interface with Agents Window.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type feature\">Feature</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-08</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"The main reason we pay for cursor is for bugbot\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v0.37.0</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gemini CLI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Implemented dynamic sandbox expansion and worktree support, added chat resume footer, UI polish improvements.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-08</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">New</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Copilot CLI now supports Bring Your Own Key (BYOK) and local model configurations for enhanced flexibility.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-07</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">Update</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Codex CLI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Updating model availability - removing gpt-5.2-codex, gpt-5.1-codex-mini, gpt-5.1-codex-max, gpt-5.1-codex, and gpt-5.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type announcement\">Announcement</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-07</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">Preview</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Copilot SDK now available in public preview, enabling developers to build custom integrations and extensions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v3.0</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://cursor.com/blog/cursor-3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Cursor</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Major interface overhaul with multi-repo layout, seamless agent handoff, agent switching options, faster performance. Includes Design Mode.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-02</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"quote\">\"With this launch of Cursor 3, I'll probably get off Cursor for good...\"</div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">New</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://github.blog/changelog/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub Copilot</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Research, plan, and code with Copilot cloud agent - new agentic capabilities for comprehensive development workflows.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-04-01</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"version-badge\">v0.118.0</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Codex CLI</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Added Windows sandbox OS-level networking, ChatGPT device code login, prompt-plus-stdin workflow, dynamic bearer token fetching.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">\n                        <span class=\"update-type release\">Release</span>\n                        <span>2026-03-31</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n\n            <!-- Technical Insights Section -->\n            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n                <h2>Technical Insights (20)</h2>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EV7WhVT270Q\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">State of AI in 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Lex Fridman Podcast with Nathan Lambert and Sebastian Raschka discussing LLMs, AI coding, scaling laws, China's AI, agents, GPUs, and AGI.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Lex Fridman • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">scaling laws</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AGI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.01919\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shadow APIs Breaking Research</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Paper audits shadow APIs claiming GPT-5/Gemini access. 187 academic papers affected, 47% performance divergence, 45% failed identity verification.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Reddit • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">research</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">verification</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.08525\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ads in AI Chatbots</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Research analyzing how LLMs handle conflicts of interest when ads are incorporated into AI chatbot interfaces.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">ArXiv • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">ethics</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.08477\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SUPERNOVA: LLM Reasoning</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Approach to improving general reasoning in LLMs using reinforcement learning on natural instructions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">ArXiv • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">reasoning</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.08401\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Verify Before You Commit</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        ACL 2026: Self-auditing framework for LLM agents ensuring faithful reasoning before committing to actions.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">ArXiv • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">verification</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.08377\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SkillClaw: Evolving Skills</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Framework allowing skills in LLM agents to evolve collectively through agentic evolver for dynamic tool-use improvements.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">ArXiv • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">tool use</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.08124\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Training Data for Search</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        ACL 2026 Findings: What makes training data valuable for agentic search systems.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">ArXiv • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">search</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.08000\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PASK: Proactive Agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Intent-aware proactive agents with long-term memory capabilities for extended context and initiative-taking.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">ArXiv • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">memory</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.08455\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KnowU-Bench: Mobile Agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Benchmark for evaluating mobile AI agents with focus on interactivity, proactivity, and personalization.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">ArXiv • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">mobile</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">evaluation</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07798\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lightweight Agent Memory</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        ACL 2026: Using small language models for lightweight memory systems in LLM agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">ArXiv • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">memory</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.07791\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SEARL: Self-Evolving Agents</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        ACL 2026: Joint optimization of policy and tool graph memory for self-evolving agents.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">ArXiv • 2026-04-10</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">agents</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">evolution</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EKOU3JWDNLI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fireship: Tech in 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Analysis of technology trends in 2026, covering AI, coding, and developer tools (1.4M views).\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Fireship • 2026-04-09</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">trends</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type tutorial\">Tutorial</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xn-gtHDsaPY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">7 Open Source AI Tools</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Fireship presents seven new open source AI coding tools and frameworks for building AI-powered applications.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Fireship • 2026-04-08</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">tools</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">open source</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/8/muse-spark/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meta's Muse Spark</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Meta's first model since Llama 4. Hosted API in private preview, available on meta.ai.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Simon Willison • 2026-04-08</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Meta</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/7/glm-5.1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GLM-5.1: 754B Parameters</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Chinese AI lab Z.ai's 754B parameter MIT-licensed model. Strong SVG/CSS generation and debugging capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Simon Willison • 2026-04-07</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">open weights</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type opinion\">Opinion</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/7/project-glasswing/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Project Glasswing</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Anthropic restricting Claude Mythos to security researchers under Project Glasswing due to advanced capabilities.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Simon Willison • 2026-04-07</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">safety</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Anthropic</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Apr/6/google-ai-edge-gallery/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google AI Edge Gallery</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Official app running Gemma 4 models directly on iPhone. E2B model is 2.54GB, fast and useful.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Simon Willison • 2026-04-06</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">Google</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">edge AI</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46489061\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LLM Coding Workflow</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Hacker News: Debating effectiveness of LLM-assisted programming and actual productivity gains versus overhead.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Hacker News • 2026-04-06</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">workflow</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">productivity</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46570115\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LLMs and Edge Cases</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Discussion about LLMs skipping edge cases in multi-step AI pipelines for 3D mesh generation.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Hacker News • 2026-04-06</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI coding</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">limitations</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type discussion\">Discussion</span>\n                        <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46342310\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn to Code in 2026</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"description\">\n                        Discussion about project-based learning approaches in the AI era, shifting from syntax to architecture understanding.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"meta\">Hacker News • 2026-04-05</div>\n                    <div class=\"topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic\">education</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI coding</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>\n                Generated by <a href=\"https://github.com/agentdaily\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Agent Code Daily</a> -\n                Powered by <a href=\"https://claude.com/claude-code\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Claude Agent SDK</a>\n            </p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n                <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hacker News</a> |\n                <a href=\"https://github.com/agentdaily/agentdaily\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GitHub</a> |\n                <a href=\"/archive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Archive</a>\n            </p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
